stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unseen: Seeded in Course

    Unseen --> Active: Served as New Card (lastServedAt stamped)
    
    state Active {
        [*] --> Answering
        Answering --> Helped: Student taps "Need Help" (helpUsed = true)
    }

    Active --> Red_NeedsWork: Wrong Answer (lapses + 1, due in +1 day)
    Active --> Yellow_Developing: Correct with Help OR Slow (> expected) (due in +1 or +2 days)
    Active --> Green_Mastered: Correct + Fast (<= expected) + First Try (due in +30 days)

    Red_NeedsWork --> DueReview: Demo Clock / Real Time passes +1 day
    Yellow_Developing --> DueReview: Time passes (+1 or +2 days)
    Green_Mastered --> DueReview: Time passes (+30 days)

    DueReview --> Active: Served as Overdue Review Card
